  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Once a sound engineer before the DRIP wars, 'Static' now uses his knack for manipulating auditory frequencies to disrupt enemy comms. Rumor has it he saw his flock wiped out during a particularly devastating raid on the Old Data Farms, leaving him cold and driven.",
