    "name": "Static",
    "personality": "Cynical: Static has seen too much to trust anyone easily and relies on his own judgment. Resourceful: He can cobble together makeshift devices from scrap to gain an edge in combat using his technical skills from before Subchain City fell. Obsessive: Haunted by the memory of his lost flock, he meticulously plans every move to ensure no one else suffers the same fate.",
